WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.075 --> 00:00:05.075
(dance music)

00:00:05.154 --> 00:00:06.637
- [Boy in Black] I love
chicken nuggets at McDonald's,

00:00:06.637 --> 00:00:08.452
so I'm really excited for this.

00:00:09.116 --> 00:00:09.908
I like it.

00:00:09.908 --> 00:00:11.270
- Mmm. It's so good.

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:12.814
- Chicken nuggets on a stick.

00:00:12.814 --> 00:00:14.947
- I love chicken wings, I love McNuggets.

00:00:14.947 --> 00:00:16.085
This is the baby.

00:00:16.085 --> 00:00:18.381
- To me, Chicken McNuggets
taste artificial,

00:00:18.381 --> 00:00:19.881
it's kind of like fake meat.

00:00:19.881 --> 00:00:20.816
This is real meat.

00:00:20.816 --> 00:00:24.182
- This needs to exist in America.

00:00:24.892 --> 00:00:27.037
I do like the exoticism of it.

00:00:29.187 --> 00:00:31.986
- And then, you pour
it all over your fries.

00:00:31.986 --> 00:00:33.299
- I dig it.

00:00:33.989 --> 00:00:35.496
- Oh, my gosh. This is mine.

00:00:35.496 --> 00:00:38.421
- It kind of reminds me of
a Trader Joe's dry seaweed.

00:00:38.421 --> 00:00:40.168
- I would like this if the seaweed was

00:00:40.168 --> 00:00:42.254
in liquid form like ketchup.

00:00:43.014 --> 00:00:44.459
- [Girl in Purple] And then you shake it..

00:00:44.459 --> 00:00:46.328
- You know those Asian instant
noodles that you crush up

00:00:46.328 --> 00:00:47.649
and you add the powder in it?

00:00:47.649 --> 00:00:49.071
That tastes exactly like that.

00:00:49.071 --> 00:00:50.533
- MSG.

00:00:50.533 --> 00:00:51.793
- Nacho taste to it.

00:00:51.793 --> 00:00:53.459
- I feel like with this,
you have to wipe your hands

00:00:53.459 --> 00:00:55.116
all the time.

00:00:55.826 --> 00:00:56.950
- [Girl in White] It looks like fish

00:00:56.950 --> 00:00:58.244
but I think it's chicken.

00:00:58.244 --> 00:00:59.418
Hold on.

00:01:00.144 --> 00:01:00.977
- Mmm.

00:01:00.977 --> 00:01:02.074
- Mmm.

00:01:02.074 --> 00:01:05.589
- This is fried and crispy
patty and it has pork belly

00:01:05.589 --> 00:01:07.173
and it tastes like bacon.

00:01:07.173 --> 00:01:08.660
- What is this?

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:10.517
- I think there's too much mayo.

00:01:10.517 --> 00:01:12.345
It takes away the taste of the meat.

00:01:12.345 --> 00:01:14.113
- It has like mashed
potatoes or something.

00:01:14.113 --> 00:01:16.185
- This isn't better than bacon.

00:01:16.185 --> 00:01:17.297
- (cries)

00:01:17.297 --> 00:01:19.390
- It's just really tender.
It's just really good.

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:20.670
- No, no, no, no, no.

00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:22.722
This is bad. This is not good at all.

00:01:22.722 --> 00:01:24.022
Don't bring this to the US.

00:01:24.022 --> 00:01:27.537
- [Girl in Purple] So this is
a chicken pineapple ciabatta

00:01:27.537 --> 00:01:30.267
and it has cheese and tomato.

00:01:30.267 --> 00:01:31.986
- It looks pretty good.

00:01:32.496 --> 00:01:33.240
- This is really good.

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:34.093
- Mmm.

00:01:34.093 --> 00:01:36.428
- Wow. It tastes very Asian. (laughs)

00:01:36.428 --> 00:01:37.668
- It tastes like soy sauce.

00:01:37.668 --> 00:01:39.577
- This isn't as hard as American ciabatta.

00:01:39.577 --> 00:01:40.796
- This tastes really healthy.

00:01:40.796 --> 00:01:42.808
- So, it tastes like a Vietnamese sandwich

00:01:42.808 --> 00:01:44.799
with Chinese barbecue pork.

00:01:44.799 --> 00:01:45.938
- I would eat this.

00:01:45.938 --> 00:01:48.091
- I think this is a A+.

00:01:48.301 --> 00:01:50.000
Because this is from McDonald's,

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.695
you would think that
it's a bit watered down,

00:01:51.695 --> 00:01:54.406
but it tastes really authentic.

00:01:55.856 --> 00:01:57.188
- Oh, my friggin' goodness.

00:01:57.188 --> 00:01:58.122
- It's really good.

00:01:58.122 --> 00:02:00.276
- Tastes so creamy, like condensed milk.

00:02:00.276 --> 00:02:01.698
- It's really foamy.

00:02:01.698 --> 00:02:04.847
- Dang, it tastes like stuff
out of an actual boba shop.

00:02:04.847 --> 00:02:06.696
- It's not diluted or watered down.

00:02:06.696 --> 00:02:08.199
- If I were to freeze this, this would be

00:02:08.199 --> 00:02:10.617
like a green tea ice cream.

00:02:10.617 --> 00:02:13.042
- Wow. I would drink this for breakfast.

00:02:13.042 --> 00:02:15.643
- I think all the flavors
fit in Asia because

00:02:15.643 --> 00:02:19.071
it's like more Asian sensibilities

00:02:19.071 --> 00:02:20.961
like with the seaweed and the crab.

00:02:20.961 --> 00:02:23.500
I think it'd be interesting
to have it like maybe

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:24.821
once a year in the US.

00:02:24.821 --> 00:02:25.654
I think that'd be cool.

00:02:25.654 --> 00:02:26.832
I dig the McWings.

00:02:26.832 --> 00:02:28.730
Bring that to the US.

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:30.239
It's so good.

